 function $F(x)$ is continuous at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{3}.$ \n\nTherefore, the Fourier series of $f(x)$ converges to \n\n$$\nf\\,(-\\frac{\\pi }{3})=cos\\,(-\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480300 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{3}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480300 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480300 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "752a3ed9-4c29-5165-ac74-445a7667e23c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480334 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480334 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480334 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "857250c9-a9b1-5080-b2c5-1728296672ed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480558 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186480300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480558 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480558 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480558 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186480300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480558 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "539ad74a-5113-59bb-99ce-f5b195bb6b58" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480583 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186480334 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480583 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480583 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480583 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186480334 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186480583 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8e653195-c3d5-582e-822a-b0c443f4aade" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186481674 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186481686 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186481688 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186481693 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186481706 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186481567 #e